DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
11089::$$$message_0088_0000_0000$$$::"Emiya, let's have lunch."[lr]::
11090::$$$message_0088_0000_0001$$$::I don't know if something strange happened to him, but Shinji invited me to have lunch.[lr]::
11091::$$$message_0088_0000_0002$$$::It's sudden, but it happens a few times a year so it's not that surprising.::
11092::$$$message_0088_0001_0000$$$::"Sure, but I have lunch.[lr]::
11093::$$$message_0088_0001_0001$$$::What about you? Are you going to go buy something?"[lr]::
11094::$$$message_0088_0001_0002$$$::"Buying something, huh? Nah, I'm not in the mood for cheap deli crap. Either the cafeteria, or better yet, do you want to go out to eat?"[lr]::
11095::$$$message_0088_0001_0003$$$::By "out," he must mean the Miyama shopping district.[lr]::
11096::$$$message_0088_0001_0004$$$::It sounds reckless, but we should be able to make it back by fifth period if we hurry.::
11097::$$$message_0088_0002_0000$$$::"...Why not. I made my lunch, so I can give it to Gotou as a token of my appreciation."[lr]::
11098::$$$message_0088_0002_0001$$$::"Oh, you're fast for once! All right, I'll introduce a special restaurant to you out of respect for your quick deference. I found this good pasta place near my work."::
11099::$$$message_0088_0003_0000$$$::"Huh? Wait, we won't make it back to class on time if we go all the way to Shinto. Let's go to the shopping district in Miyama."[lr]::
11100::$$$message_0088_0003_0001$$$::"We can just ditch. You have enough credits, right?"::
11101::$$$message_0088_0004_0000$$$::He pesters me like there's no time to waste.[lr]::
11102::$$$message_0088_0004_0001$$$::...I have my reservations, but there's just something irresistible about the phrase "good pasta."[lr]::
11103::$$$message_0088_0004_0002$$$::Shinji, who is fussy about food, is going out of his way to bring this up. I might be able to discover a[line len=2]::
11104::$$$message_0088_0005_0000$$$::"You cretin! It isn't enough that you wallow in your own corruption, but you see fit to spread it further!"[lr]::
11105::$$$message_0088_0005_0001$$$::Issei must've been eavesdropping on us as he swoops in on our conversation like an embodiment of justice.::
11106::$$$message_0088_0006_0000$$$::"What now, Ryudou? Where we eat is none of your business. Mind your own business and we'll do as we see fit."[lr]::
11107::$$$message_0088_0006_0001$$$::"This does concern me. I cannot sit by while a friend is deceived[line len=2]no, [font italic=true]seduced[font italic=false] even[line len=2]by a bad influence of a friend. It is only natural I protect him.[lr]::
11108::$$$message_0088_0006_0002$$$::And besides, I'm the one who made plans with Emiya first. Right, Emiya?"::
11109::$$$message_0088_0007_0000$$$::"Huh... Sorry, I don't recall..."[lr]::
11110::$$$message_0088_0007_0001$$$::Though, if Issei says so, it must be true.[lr]::
11111::$$$message_0088_0007_0002$$$::Lately, I can't remember things clearly.[lr]::
11112::$$$message_0088_0007_0003$$$::We must've made plans at the student council room in the morning.[lr]::
11113::$$$message_0088_0007_0004$$$::But I really don't remember anything.::
11114::$$$message_0088_0008_0000$$$::"Right? ...Good grief, I was waiting for you to point it out, but he's extremely pushy.[lr]::
11115::$$$message_0088_0008_0001$$$::Let's go, Emiya. I shall get some special tea leaves out today. Some Italian place in Shinto won't even compare to them."[lr]::
11116::$$$message_0088_0008_0002$$$::"Oh."[lr]::
11117::$$$message_0088_0008_0003$$$::He pulls my arm and starts to drag me to the student council room.::
11118::$$$message_0088_0009_0000$$$::"Ha, get a load of this guy.[lr]::
11119::$$$message_0088_0009_0001$$$::It's the usual 'come to the student council room if you're so free,' right?[lr]::
11120::$$$message_0088_0009_0002$$$::That doesn't count as 'lunch plans.' Sounds more like an order to me. Since when is it school policy to eat in the student council room if you have nothing better to do, Mr. Student President?"::
11121::$$$message_0088_0010_0000$$$::"As if I would make such a rule![lr]::
11122::$$$message_0088_0010_0001$$$::We agreed to have lunch in the office. Tell him, Emiya. We clearly made plans this morning."[lr]::
11123::$$$message_0088_0010_0002$$$::"Huh...did we?"[lr]::
11124::$$$message_0088_0010_0003$$$::"We did. Our eyes met at the end of homeroom period.[lr]::
11125::$$$message_0088_0010_0004$$$::Come on, we have an agreement to eat in the student council room if I cough, and if you cough, we eat in the classroom."::
11126::$$$message_0088_0011_0000$$$::He shakes his head.[lr]::
11127::$$$message_0088_0011_0001$$$::"...Ah..."[lr]::
11128::$$$message_0088_0011_0002$$$::...Sorry, I didn't realize we had such a rule for three years.[lr]::
11129::$$$message_0088_0011_0003$$$::I thought that he sometimes coughs unnaturally, but I see, so that's how he decided our meeting spot.::
11130::$$$message_0088_0012_0000$$$::"...Hey.[lr]::
11131::$$$message_0088_0012_0001$$$::I've thought this before, but are you a square, Ryudou?"[lr]::
11132::$$$message_0088_0012_0002$$$::"That's rude. I don't want to be called that by you, who easily crosses the line."::
11133::$$$message_0088_0013_0000$$$::Sparks fly from both sides.[lr]::
11134::$$$message_0088_0013_0001$$$::It's not showy, but it's still a tense battle.[lr]::
11135::$$$message_0088_0013_0002$$$::I even want to open my lunch and enjoy the show, but then I would be the only one that would get full.::
11136::$$$message_0088_0014_0000$$$::"Ah, hello, both of you?[lr]::
11137::$$$message_0088_0014_0001$$$::Lunch break isn't that long, so settle this later.[lr]::
11138::$$$message_0088_0014_0002$$$::Why don't we just go to the cafeteria with the three of us? Shinji will give up going out to eat, and Issei will give up eating at the student council room. That will balance things out, right?"::
11139::$$$message_0088_0015_0000$$$::"I refuse. I'm gonna go eat out if I say I'm eating out. [cacheimage storage=慎二制服04b(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=慎二制服04b(中)]Come on, I'll treat you to lunch so let's go, Emiya. Let's hit town afterwards. I have plans to go to a mixer with girls from West campus."[lr]::
11140::$$$message_0088_0015_0001$$$::"Ah! I don't get you, Matou. I'm telling you not to get Emiya involved down the wrong path. Also, if you like Western food that much, just move to Western Europe forever. And don't invite Emiya to a mixer."::
11141::$$$message_0088_0016_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
11142::$$$message_0088_0016_0001$$$::It seems like my compromise won't work either.[lr]::
11143::$$$message_0088_0016_0002$$$::It seems like neither of them will budge even a micron to eat lunch with the other.::
11144::$$$message_0088_0017_0000$$$::"Whatever. Do what you want. I'm going to go eat at the cafeteria."[lr]::
11145::$$$message_0088_0017_0001$$$::"Hold on, Emiya, that's too heartless![cacheimage storage=一成02a(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=200][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=一成02a(中)] Isn't it your duty as a friend to make a clear decision?[lr]::
11146::$$$message_0088_0017_0002$$$::It goes against justice to throw either one away, but you should show your ironclad sincerity now!"::
11147::$$$message_0088_0018_0000$$$::"I agree! It makes me want to throw up that my opinion matches Ryudou, but I completely agree![lr]::
11148::$$$message_0088_0018_0001$$$::Come on, hurry up and tell us, Emiya! Tell him who you're picking, and the other will lonesomely eat lunch by themselves!"::
11149::$$$message_0088_0019_0000$$$::"Then, Issei."[lr]::
11150::$$$message_0088_0019_0001$$$::"Why!? It's a pasta place in Shinto![lr]::
11151::$$$message_0088_0019_0002$$$::And there's a mixer after! It's a dreamy three hours with girls that even I rate as good! It's obvious this one's more fun![lr]::
11152::$$$message_0088_0019_0003$$$::Geez, I really don't get you, Emiya!"::
11153::$$$message_0088_0020_0000$$$::"Yeah. I'm interested in the pasta place, and I'm not good with mixers, but I actually kinda like them. But the biggest problem is..."[lr]::
11154::$$$message_0088_0020_0001$$$::I point at the class schedule.[lr]::
11155::$$$message_0088_0020_0002$$$::Yes. Fifth period is our Fuji-nee's class.::
11156::$$$message_0088_0021_0000$$$::"...Yeah. It's a bit unfortunate, [cacheimage storage=一成01b腕(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=200][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=一成01b腕(中)]but that's a very student-like reason. Emiya needs to be like that, yes."[cacheimage storage=慎二制服01g(中)][wvs][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=慎二制服01g(中)][lr]::
11157::$$$message_0088_0021_0001$$$::"That's why, so you should give it up too, Shinji. Let's eat lunch together in the student council room. I'll share my lunch with you if you don't want deli bread."[lr]::
11158::$$$message_0088_0021_0002$$$::"Heh, no need for that. He's so full of bluster; I wouldn't think that he would have lunch anywhere in school.[lr]::
11159::$$$message_0088_0021_0003$$$::Isn't that right, Matou?"::
11160::$$$message_0088_0022_0000$$$::"H-humph, that's right, Ryudou. I won't go to the student council room even if you begged me to.[lr]::
11161::$$$message_0088_0022_0001$$$::Whatever, you guys can spend a lowly mediocre lunch break like usual. But don't get me wrong, I'll show you guys who the real winner is!"[lr]::
11162::$$$message_0088_0022_0002$$$::Shinji laughs, as if he's crying[se volume=60 storage=se021.wav] and leaves.::
11163::$$$message_0088_0023_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
11164::$$$message_0088_0023_0001$$$::Oh man.[lr]::
11165::$$$message_0088_0023_0002$$$::I can't really tell myself, but I wonder if there was something wrong with my actions and words.::
11166::$$$message_0088_0024_0000$$$::"Hey, Issei. Was that my fault?"[lr]::
11167::$$$message_0088_0024_0001$$$::"...Yeah.[lr]::
11168::$$$message_0088_0024_0002$$$::I won't sympathize with Matou, but you should choose your words a bit more carefully, Emiya. If I was Matou, I would've finished myself off."[lr]::
11169::$$$message_0088_0024_0003$$$::"Huh?"[lr]::
11170::$$$message_0088_0024_0004$$$::I don't get Issei either.[lr]::
11171::$$$message_0088_0024_0005$$$::While he's saying he won't sympathize with Shinji, he has his hands together giving a silent prayer at Shinji's desk.::
11172::$$$message_0088_0025_0000$$$::Lunch break ends, and the bell rings.[lr]::
11173::$$$message_0088_0025_0001$$$::We finish eating our lunch at the student council room, and Issei and I get ready for the bell that signals class to start in five minutes.[lr]::
11174::$$$message_0088_0025_0002$$$::Shinji is nowhere to be seen, so it seems like he hasn't returned since then.::
11175::$$$message_0088_0026_0000$$$::"...Hm. All's well that ends well.[lr]::
11176::$$$message_0088_0026_0001$$$::Now that it has come to this, we did a bad thing to Matou. In particular, today's tuna cutlet was fantastic. I wouldn't mind letting him try a piece[line len=2][wvl][se volume=50 storage=se664.wav][cacheimage storage=一成01c(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=200][chgfg time=300 storage=一成01c(中)]Mm?"[lr]::
11177::$$$message_0088_0026_0002$$$::Issei is not the only one who realized the abnormality.[lr]::
11178::$$$message_0088_0026_0003$$$::Everyone in the classroom is frowning and looking at the hallway, wondering what's going on.::
11179::$$$message_0088_0027_0000$$$::"...Oh."[lr]::
11180::$$$message_0088_0027_0001$$$::A circus-like clamor approaches.[lr]::
11181::$$$message_0088_0027_0002$$$::The ones moving through the hallway are Shinji and a bunch of first-year girls who seem to be surrounding him.[lr]::
11182::$$$message_0088_0027_0003$$$::All of them are holding their lunch and feeding Shinji while walking.::
11183::$$$message_0088_0028_0000$$$::"W-what the[line len=2]"[lr]::
11184::$$$message_0088_0028_0001$$$::Issei stands motionless, stunned.[lr]::
11185::$$$message_0088_0028_0002$$$::Shinji stops ostentatiously for a moment.::
11186::$$$message_0088_0029_0000$$$::"Oh, well if it isn't the sad dudes who ate lunch by themselves.[lr]::
11187::$$$message_0088_0029_0001$$$::How is it? Was today's lunch miserable as could be? No cries of joy from girls? You didn't get any 'oh my god, you look amazing, Shinji [whitestar] ahhh!'?"[lr]::
11188::$$$message_0088_0029_0002$$$::Issei's shoulders are shaking violently.[lr]::
11189::$$$message_0088_0029_0003$$$::Shinji's good mood is at its peak right now.::
11190::$$$message_0088_0030_0000$$$::"Me? [cacheimage storage=慎二制服02c(遠)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=慎二制服02c(遠)]I had the best time![wvl][se storage=se664.wav] It was so fun, I can't even put it into words! Man, too bad. I wish I could've shared this fun with you guys, too!"[lr]::
11191::$$$message_0088_0030_0001$$$::"You really are easy to read, you bastard!"[lr]::
11192::$$$message_0088_0030_0002$$$::"Oh [font italic=true]no[font italic=false], we should flee, everyone! That's the old and nippy student council president; he'll enforce a dress code with zero fashion sense if you get caught!"::
11193::$$$message_0088_0031_0000$$$::The Shinji daytime circus runs away down the hallway cheerfully.[lr]::
11194::$$$message_0088_0031_0001$$$::The way they run off almost seems rehearsed.::
11195::$$$message_0088_0032_0000$$$::"I won't let you escape, Matou...! [wvl][wm canskip=0][cacheimage storage=一成02a(中)][wvl][se storage=se089.wav][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=一成02a(中)]Emiya, tell Ms. Fujimura that I've gone to finish off one of Homurahara's Three Great Monsters!"[lr]::
11196::$$$message_0088_0032_0001$$$::Issei jumps out into the hallway with incredible speed.[lr]::
11197::$$$message_0088_0032_0002$$$::Even then, he doesn't run in the hallway, as expected of the student council president.[lr]::
11198::$$$message_0088_0032_0003$$$::That's a walk that surpasses running.::
11199::$$$message_0088_0033_0000$$$::"...Yeah, [wvl][se storage=se020.wav]they both lose."[lr]::
11200::$$$message_0088_0033_0001$$$::The fifth period bell rings.[lr]::
11201::$$$message_0088_0033_0002$$$::There's four more months until graduation from today.[lr]::
11202::$$$message_0088_0033_0003$$$::Issei Ryudou missed class for the first time.::

